      <h2>What this is not</h2>
      <p>
        It is not a listicle of untranslatable words, not a ranking of cultures, not a
        toolkit for performing sensitivity, and not a public pillar built on games or
        entertainment franchises. Comparative work will be slow, cited, and revisable.
      </p>
      <p>
        A fuller methods paper — protocols, review standards, and catalog taxonomy —
        will be published here as it is written. Until then, treat this page as the
        hypothesis we are willing to be corrected on.
      </p>
